    {
      "name": "Mindless Grudge",
      "actions": -1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature deals damage to the murder</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The murder begrudges the triggering creature. The murder's swarming hunger deals 3 extra damage to that creature. The effect ends if the murder begrudges a different creature.</p>",
